king about people  it is true people choosing between  heating and eating we're talking about  people who've had their wages virtually  frozen for nearly 12 years it's tough  out there so yes we've got to protect  people in this short term and that does  mean an increase in borrowing in the  short term but the most important thing  is i said time and time again in our  interviews you borrow to invest  and that's why investment in alternative  energy sources in insulating our homes  is the right thing to do at the moment  because you'll reap such huge rewards  and actually in terms of energy and  alternative energy sources and  insulation you'll reap them pretty quick  as well  sure mr mcdonald  given given our previous conversations  you might not be happy about this but we  whenever we have talked we've always  ended up talking about what's going on  within within the labour party and so it  is again today recent recently of course  you did pull out of the stop the war  rally after pressure from the leader's  office because of their stance over you  know the extent to which nato is  responsible responsible for for what is  going on in ukraine  were you entirely happy to withdraw from  that event and genuinely what is your  view of the extent to which nato is  responsible uh from the world's position  for what we're seeing i i would drive my  name for the statement and withdraw  because the the leader of the labour  party said so  and i because also the statement was out  of date and the i said then you know  we're in a war situation what we don't  want is internal political debates and  discussions like that and it would be a  complete distraction from the focus that  we should have on securing peace we've  got time to debate the issues around  nato and russia and the long term  what we've got to do now everything  every word we use now has got to be  about securing peace and we shouldn't be  distracted from that we too many people  are suffering at the moment so that was  my focus then it's my focus now and  remember  people seem to forget i was one of the  people who helped set up the ukraine  solidarity campaign over 10 or 11 years  ago we were campaigning with ukrainian  trade unions and others trying to secure  the long-term democratic future of the  ukraine i think that's the issue for me  now and i think there will be a time  when we debate the security system for  the whole of europe in the future what  will reassure people what will give us  peace now i think the focus has got to  be on securing peace yeah unfortunately  we are out of time so we can't even  debate it here john mcdonnell good to  have you on the programme once again do  take care  thank you
 

